  "boundary_basis": "Approximate, not gazetted. Police jurisdiction polygons are not in open data: an Overpass query for boundary=police over Jaipur returns zero. Each area is the set of links whose midpoint is nearest that station, which is the Voronoi cell computed directly. Zones roll those up by bearing from the walled city. Replace with the Commissionerate's own shapefile when supplied; nothing downstream changes.",
